  "text": "Evidence Quest\nTHE GARDEN ADVENTURE\nSaved in this browser\nBackpack\nHelp\nPause\nWhat’s happening\n\nPip is here. Choose the nearby action.\n\nYOUR ADVENTURE\nTake Grandma’s story to Mara.\n\nCarry the copy back across the footbridge to Mara.\n\nWhere is that?\nThe riverbank\nPlaces & scene description\n\nPip is on the dock side of the river. The two wooden bridge sections are joined. Dock-side end fastened. Garden-side end fastened. The separate seed boat is by the dock-side bank. The seed is planted in the soil. Pip carries Mara's page. The lantern-flower is open. Pip carries Grandma’s copy to Mara at the passenger dock.\n\nGo to Mara\nGo to the bridge pieces\nGo to Grandma\nGo to Sol\nOpen lantern stories\nInspect a particular flower\nYou are Pip · Explore, talk and help\nTalk to Mara\nE\nGo to Sol\nGo to Grandma\nLantern stories",
